{"sourceUrl":"https://marx.hnu.edu.cn/info/1034/3728.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:53:21.005003+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://marx.hnu.edu.cn/info/1034/3728.htm","html":"<div><div>\n<p><span> <span>一、招生专业</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>学术学位：马克思主义理论、哲学</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>二、申请条件</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（一）拥护中国共产党的领导，遵纪守法，品德良好；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（二）</span></span><span>202</span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span>届普通全日制本科毕业生，取得本科所在学校的推荐免试生资格；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（三）研究兴趣浓厚，有较强的创新意识、创新能力和专业能力；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（四）身体健康状况应符合国家规定的体检要求</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>三、申请程序</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>（一）预报名</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>相关要求参照预报名通知。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>（二）资格审查</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>我院将根据申请人提供的申请材料进行资格审查，择优确定参加</span></span><span><span>面试</span></span><span><span>考核的名单。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>（三）考核</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>考核形式</span></span><span><span>：线下面试</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>考核地点：马克思主义学院</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>考核时间：</span></span><span>202</span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>年</span></span><span>9</span><span><span>月</span></span><span>1</span><span><span>9</span></span><span><span>日</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>考核具体时间、地点也将通过学校招生管理系统发布，请报名成功的同学关注招生管理系统。确认参加</span></span><span><span>面试</span></span><span><span>的考生须在规定时间内在招生系统中进行确认，未确认的视为放弃。确认参加</span></span><span><span>面试</span></span><span><span>的考生请加</span></span><span>QQ</span><span><span>群</span></span><span><span>985726233</span></span><span><span>马克思主义学院</span></span><span>202</span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span>级硕士推免生群（以</span><span>“学校</span></span><span>+</span><span><span>专业</span></span><span>+</span><span><span>姓名</span><span>”命名）。</span></span></p>\n<p><span>1. </span><span><span>考核内容：</span></span><span><span>面试</span></span><span><span>主要由外语能力测试、专业素质和能力测试以及综合素质测试三部分组成。</span></span></p>\n<p><span>2. </span><span><span>考核成绩：</span></span><span><span>考试总分值</span></span><span>100</span><span><span>分</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>四、拟录取</span></span></p>\n<p><span>1.</span><span><span>学院按照</span></span><span><span>“</span></span><span><span>择优录取、保证质量、宁缺毋滥</span></span><span><span>”</span></span><span><span>的原则，根据考核成绩，综合考生思想政治表现、身心健康状况等，在各专业接收推免生计划限额内择优拟录取。</span></span></p>\n<p><span>2.2026</span><span><span>年</span></span><span>9</span><span><span>月</span></span><span>21</span><span><span>日</span></span><span>9:00</span><span><span>起，获得推免生资格且考核合格的申请人可在</span></span><span><span>“</span></span><span><span>全国推荐免试攻读研究生（免初试、转段）信息公开管理服务系统</span></span><span><span>”</span></span><span><span>（网址：</span></span><span>https://yz.chsi.com.cn/tm</span><span><span>，以下简称教育部推免服务系统）报名。</span></span><span>9</span><span><span>月</span></span><span>22</span><span><span>日</span></span><span>8:00</span><span><span>开始，学院开始发放复试通知；</span></span><span>9</span><span><span>月</span></span><span>24</span><span><span>日</span></span><span>8:00</span><span><span>开始，学院将向拟接收的申请人发送待录取通知。</span></span><span>9</span><span><span>月</span></span><span>24</span><span><span>日</span></span><span>14:00</span><span><span>开始，收到通知的申请人须在规定时间内（另行通知）在系统内完成复试确认和待录取确认操作，逾期未完成者视为放弃待录取资格。</span></span></p>\n<p><span>3.</span><span><span>针对未进行预报名但在教育部推免服务系统报名的考生，学院将根据接收指标剩余情况决定是否发放复试通知和组织复试。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>五、联系方式</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>联系人：</span></span><span><span>王</span></span><span><span>老师</span></span><span><span> 联系电话：</span></span><span>0731—88822297</span></p>\n<p><span><span>六、</span></span><span><span>其他</span></span></p>\n<p><span>1.</span><span><span>对学术不端及弄虚作假者，不论何时，一经查实，即按相关规定取消报考资格、录取资格或取消学籍。</span></span></p>\n<p><span>2.</span><span><span>学校将对新生入学资格进行复查，推免生如在录取当年入学时未取得国家承认的本科毕业证书，录取资格无效。</span></span></p>\n<p><span>3.</span><span><span>根据教育部政策规定，取得录取资格的推免生不得再报名参加当年硕士研究生招生考试，否则取消其推免录取资格。</span></span></p>\n<p><span>4.</span><span><span>其他未尽事宜，按照湖南大学招生相关文件及我院补充通知执行。</span></span></p>\n<p><br/></p>\n<p><span><span>湖南大学</span></span><span><span>马克思</span></span><span><span>主义</span></span><span><span>学院</span></span></p>\n<p><span>202</span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>年</span></span><span>9</span><span><span>月</span></span><span>1</span><span><span>5</span></span><span><span>日</span></span></p>\n<p><br/></p>\n<p><br/></p>\n</div></div>","textSha256":"1dc94ed8d7ffc2c0997e8ee31a9ec164db5516d3760828709b8e61137fcbad11","textLength":1047,"sourceSha256":"e992cc7c44205ca90616c22a79351486be3a06550965bf72a664ff753a99b944","selector":"#vsb_content","attachments":[{"name":"马克思主义学院接收2027年推免生（含直博生.xls","url":"https://marx.hnu.edu.cn/system/_content/download.jsp?urltype=news.DownloadAttachUrl&owner=2115310192&wbfileid=18160239"}],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-4a6a5da3a329ee3c6eb1","title":"2026年湖南大学马克思主义学院2027年招收推荐免试攻读研究生（含直博生）复试录取工作实施细则","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:53:21.005003+00:00"}
